<section class="sx-hero"><div class="sx-bubbles" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="sx-w sx-hero-g"><div class="sx-hero-t"><p class="sx-scr sx-hero-k">hello, sunshine</p><h1>Fruit,<br>frozen<br><span>beautifully.</span></h1><p class="sx-lead">Sorbetx is a bright kitchen guide to sorbet. Balance sugar like a pro so every scoop is smooth, discover flavour pairings that sing, and make silky sorbet with or without a machine.</p>
<div class="sx-hero-a"><a class="sx-btn" href="#sugar">Balance my sorbet</a><a class="sx-btn sx-btn-2" href="#pair">Spin the flavour wheel</a></div></div>
<div class="sx-hero-v"><div class="sx-cone"><div class="sx-scoop sx-s1"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571554205671-1341c2b24929?auto=format&fit=crop&w=420&h=420&q=75" alt="a cup of sorbet" width="420" height="420" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="sx-scoop sx-s2"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1629385744299-74b9cf013f52?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="five small bowls of colourful scoops" width="300" height="300" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="sx-wafer"></div></div><p class="sx-chip sx-c1">0% dairy</p><p class="sx-chip sx-c2">100% fruit</p></div></div></section>

<section class="sx-s sx-sg" id="sugar"><div class="sx-w sx-sg-g"><div class="sx-card"><p class="sx-pill">tool one</p><h2 class="rv">Sugar balance calculator</h2><p class="sx-p">Sugar does more than sweeten sorbet: it keeps it soft enough to scoop. Choose a fruit and how much purée you have, and we work out the syrup so the mix lands in the sweet spot.</p>
<label class="sx-lb" for="sg-f">Fruit</label><select id="sg-f" class="sx-sel"><option value="0" selected>Lemon (juice + zest)</option><option value="1">Strawberry</option><option value="2">Mango</option><option value="3">Raspberry</option><option value="4">Pineapple</option><option value="5">Watermelon</option><option value="6">Peach</option><option value="7">Banana</option></select>
<label class="sx-lb" for="sg-p">Fruit purée <b id="sg-pv">500 g</b></label><input type="range" id="sg-p" min="200" max="1500" step="50" value="500" class="sx-rng">
<p class="sx-lb">Texture you want</p><div class="sx-seg" id="sg-t" role="group" aria-label="Texture"><button type="button" data-v="0">Firm &amp; fruity</button><button type="button" class="on" data-v="1">Classic scoop</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Extra soft</button></div></div>
<div class="sx-sg-r" aria-live="polite"><div class="sx-therm"><div class="sx-therm-t"><i id="sg-m"></i><span class="z z1">icy</span><span class="z z2">scoopable</span><span class="z z3">slushy</span></div><p><b id="sg-b">27%</b> sugar in the mix</p></div><ul class="sx-rec" id="sg-l"></ul><p class="sx-p sx-note" id="sg-n"></p><div class="sx-sg-i"><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577234231282-d5017c6ac8b4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="sliced grapefruits" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure><figure><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1530983820165-35b7aa38a105?auto=format&fit=crop&w=300&h=300&q=75" alt="fresh raspberries" width="300" height="300" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></div></section>

<section class="sx-s sx-pr" id="pair"><div class="sx-w sx-pr-g"><div class="sx-wheel-w"><div class="sx-wheel" id="pr-w"><span style="--i:0;--c:#FFE27A">Lemon</span><span style="--i:1;--c:#FF8FAB">Strawberry</span><span style="--i:2;--c:#FFB347">Mango</span><span style="--i:3;--c:#FF5C8A">Raspberry</span><span style="--i:4;--c:#9BE3C8">Watermelon</span><span style="--i:5;--c:#FFC6A5">Peach</span><span style="--i:6;--c:#F9D55B">Pineapple</span><span style="--i:7;--c:#B8A9FF">Blueberry</span></div><div class="sx-hub" id="pr-hub">Lemon</div><span class="sx-ptr" aria-hidden="true"></span></div>
<div><p class="sx-pill sx-pill-2">tool two</p><h2 class="rv">Flavour wheel</h2><p class="sx-p">Pick a fruit, or spin the wheel. We suggest herbs, spices and a second fruit that pair well, plus a finishing touch to try.</p><div class="sx-fr" id="pr-f" role="group" aria-label="Fruit"><button type="button" data-v="0" class="on">Lemon</button><button type="button" data-v="1">Strawberry</button><button type="button" data-v="2">Mango</button><button type="button" data-v="3">Raspberry</button><button type="button" data-v="4">Watermelon</button><button type="button" data-v="5">Peach</button><button type="button" data-v="6">Pineapple</button><button type="button" data-v="7">Blueberry</button></div><button type="button" class="sx-btn sx-btn-s" id="pr-spin">Surprise me</button>
<div class="sx-pairs" aria-live="polite"><div><span>Herb</span><b id="pr-h"></b></div><div><span>Spice</span><b id="pr-s"></b></div><div><span>Second fruit</span><b id="pr-x"></b></div><div><span>Finish with</span><b id="pr-z"></b></div></div><figure class="sx-pr-i"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1438907046657-4ae137eb8c5e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=520&h=220&q=75" alt="frozen blueberries, raspberries and blackberries" width="520" height="220" loading="lazy"></figure></div></div></section>

<section class="sx-s sx-fls"><div class="sx-w"><h2 class="rv">Flavours we keep coming back to</h2><div class="sx-fls-g"><figure class="sx-fl rv" style="--c:#FFD166"><div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614482322543-15e7f3a41c3a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=400&q=75" alt="a glass bowl of yellow and red frozen dessert" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Mango &amp; passion fruit</figcaption></figure><figure class="sx-fl rv" style="--c:#FF8FAB"><div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532678465554-94846274c297?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=400&q=75" alt="strawberry frozen dessert in a clear glass bowl" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Strawberry &amp; basil</figcaption></figure><figure class="sx-fl rv" style="--c:#B8A9FF"><div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1671527293507-31f5f3a9a764?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=400&q=75" alt="a scoop in a blue bowl" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Blueberry &amp; lime</figcaption></figure><figure class="sx-fl rv" style="--c:#FF6B8B"><div><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507079477490-37bfa7d4edec?auto=format&fit=crop&w=400&h=400&q=75" alt="a raspberry dessert on a grey tray" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy"></div><figcaption>Raspberry &amp; rose</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

